      "value": "I have the issue only with the right hand gesture, despite having an exactly identical setup for both hands.\n\nI'm wondering if the left hand being set to \"tracking\" is potentially overwriting the right hand state?\n\nI can see in game that the tracking value is still set to \"Tracking\" despite being on \"Animation\" for that gesture with the debug menu.",
