      "value": "@{5f3ff3e88e5e5c426804bc73|full_name}: if you've got two hands both capable of setting that tracking vs animation, then it's likely that whatever was done last takes effect. So you're likely holding a gesture in the right hand, and any movement for gesture in left hand is going to reset the the eyes to tracking",
