      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: I agree with your scenario, but this isn't what I do to trigger the issue.\n\nI started with both hands in Idle position, only change the Left hand gesture, lock them to be sure and the blinking doesn't happen.\n\nIf I do this with the Right hand, the blinking is going through.",
