  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Open Unity with any avatar\n\n2. In the FX layer, select the gestures and set Animator Tracking Control - to animation for a gesture that needs blinking to not be active\n\n3. Set every other gestures to tracking\n\n4. Upload the avatar\n\n5. Launch VRChat\n\n6. Use the gesture that should disable the blinking with one hand\n\n7. Try with the other hand\n\nBlinking will still go through sometimes",
